# brandish's targets. In the bakery (3009), south, south, west and north of the temple, with the baker (a shopkeeper,
# so is_safe protects him): Pickpocket (13, staves at 75%) brandishes a burnt staff (1327) of kick, an offensive
# skill: it passes over players and tries the baker, who's safe. Then a burnt staff of heal, a defensive spell: it
# passes over mobs and heals Pickpocket. Each staff has four charges, as
# the rolls can fail. A fido (3062) comes in before the heal staff, so it's first in the room and the staff passes
# over it.
@connect pick
Pickpocket
psswrd
@return
@return
south
@pulse 1
south
@pulse 1
west
@pulse 1
north
@pulse 1
@obj 1327 3009 20 4 4 116 0
get staff
hold staff
brandish
@pulse 24
brandish
@pulse 24
brandish
@pulse 24
@mob 3062 3009
@obj 1327 3009 20 4 4 57 0
get staff
hold staff
brandish
@pulse 24
brandish
@pulse 24
brandish
@pulse 24
brandish
